        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fred Gehrke, Christian Yelich\n- Organizations: Los Angeles Rams, Miami Marlins, Major League Baseball\n- Events: 1948 Los Angeles Rams season, 2010 Major League Baseball Draft\n- Concepts: helmet logo, family relationship\n\nFacts:\n- In 1948, the Los Angeles Rams debuted the first helmet logo in league history during the 1948 Los Angeles Rams season.\n- In 1948, Los Angeles Rams running back Fred Gehrke conceived the idea for the first helmet logo in league history.\n- In 2010, Christian Yelich was drafted out of high school by the Miami Marlins in the first round, 23rd overall, of the 2010 Major League Baseball Draft.\n- Fred Gehrke is the great-grandfather of Miami Marlins player Christian Yelich.",
